  "source_code": "x=int(input())\r\nfor _ in range(x):\r\n    n=int(input())\r\n    a=list(map(int,input().split()))\r\n    a.sort(reverse=True)\r\n    pr=[0]*(3*n+1)\r\n    for i in range(3*n):\r\n        pr[i+1]=pr[i]+a[i]\r\n    res=0\r\n    for p in range(n+1):\r\n        y=0\r\n        z=n-p\r\n        while y<z:\r\n            b=(y+z)//2\r\n            q=p+2*b\r\n            r=3*n-2*p-b\r\n            l=a[q]+a[q+1]-3*a[r-1]\r\n            if l>=0:\r\n                y=b+1 \r\n            else:\r\n                z=b \r\n        for k in (y,y-1):\r\n            if 0<=k<=n-p:\r\n                q=p+2*k \r\n                r=3*n-2*p-k\r\n                c=2*pr[p]+pr[q]+3*pr[r]\r\n                res=max(res,c)\r\n    print(res)",
